From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Birk Skyum <birk.skyum@pm.me>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 17:10:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: arm: qcom: Add the Microsoft Surface Laptop 8
 15-inch

The Surface Laptop 8's 15-inch model is the 13.8-inch board with another
panel and touchscreen, on the same 12-core Snapdragon X2 Elite (Mahua).
Add its compatible to the Mahua boards.

Signed-off-by: Birk Skyum <birk.skyum@pm.me>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/qcom.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/qcom.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/qcom.yaml
index 6b13dd0..d8921d9 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/qcom.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/qcom.yaml
@@ -183,6 +183,7 @@ properties:
       - items:
           - enum:
               - microsoft,surface-laptop-8-13p8
+              - microsoft,surface-laptop-8-15
               - hp,omnibook-5-16-bf1xxx
               - hp,omnibook-x16-cp1
               - qcom,mahua-crd
-- 
